   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Among several reasons",
   "texto": [
    "**-고 해서** introduce una razón o circunstancia entre otras posibles: 좋다 → **좋고 해서** (como además hacía buen tiempo), 피곤하다 → **피곤하고 해서** (como además estaba cansado). It is common in conversation, but it is not simply an informal version of «because».",
    "날씨도 **좋고 해서** 공원에 갔어요 = como además hacía buen tiempo, fuimos al parque."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Front to - - -",
   "texto": [
    "**-아/어서** often directly links a cause and its consequence. **-고 해서** presents a reason more openly, often with other implicit circumstances.",
    "As I also have another commitment, I will leave first."
